### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### GET /v1/orders/{orderId}/coupons — Applied coupons
### OrderController.getAppliedCoupons
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

@orderBase = {{host}}/v1/orders

###
# @name get-applied-coupons-ok
### [1] Happy path - order with coupons applied
GET {{orderBase}}/{{orderId}}/coupons

###
# @name get-applied-coupons-no-coupons
### [2] Order without coupons (expect empty list)
GET {{orderBase}}/{{randomUuid}}/coupons
